 "text": "Auditor's Office - Custer County, South Dakota\nOctober 18, 2026\nCuster County, South Dakota\nHome\nHistory\nDepartments »\nAuditor’s Office\nAirport\nBuilding/Ground Maintenance\nClerk of Courts\nConservation District\nDirector of Equalization\nEmergency Services\nExtension Office\nOffice of Public Health Nursing Services\nHighway Department\nHuman Resources\nGIS – Geographical Information System\nPlanning and Economic\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff’s Office\nTreasurer’s Office\nStates Attorney\nVeterans Services\nWeed and Pest Control\nCounty Library\nCommissioners\nVoter Info\nLinks\nJobs\nContact Us\nAuditor’s Office\nWhat we do:\nThe Auditor’s Office provides a number of services to the citizens of the County. The primary responsibility of the Auditor is the auditing of all financial records of the County. The office is also responsible for the apportioning of taxes collected by the Treasurer to be disbursed to the Schools, Cities, and other special assessment entities. The Office is in charge of Accounts Payable, Accounts Receivable, Payroll, Beer and Liquor Licensing, Budgets, Tax Levy, and Official Recorder of minutes for the Board of County Commissioners. The Office maintains all voter records and administers all elections at the county level or above.\nLinks:\n2025 Pay 2026 Levy Amounts\nCounty Audit Reports 2022 & 2023\nSample Ballot\nRoad District Codified Laws\nVoter Registration Form\nAbsentee Ballot Application\nVoter Information Portal\nSecretary of State\nFire Agenda\nFire Minutes\nRaffle Notice\nAmerican Rescue Plan Act Information\n2025 Pay Scale\nCuster County Finance Officer: Dawn McLaughlin\ndmclaughlin@custercountysd.com | (605) 673-8114\nDeputy Finance Officer: Michelle Zerfas\nmzerfas@custercountysd.com | (605) 673-8179\nDeputy: Barbara Cox\nbcox@custercountysd.com | (605) 673-8110\nDeputy: Dana Benjamin\ndbenjamin@custercountysd.com | (605) 673-8111\nDeputy: Stacy Armbruster\nsarmbruster@custercountysd.com | (605) 673-8108\nDeputy: Jerrica Henrichs\njhenrichs@custercountysd.com | (605) 673-8126\nA/R Liens Clerk: McKinsey Scroggin\nmscroggin@custercountysd.com | (605) 673-8109\nMailing Address:\nCuster County Auditor\n420 Mount Rushmore Rd.\nCuster, SD 57730\nHours:\nMonday thru Friday\n8:00 am – 5:00 pm\nCopyright © 2026 on Genesis Framework · WordPress · Log in\nOfficial Website of Custer County, South Dakota\n-->\nAddress: 420 Mt Rushmore Rd\nCuster, SD 57730 Phone: (605) 673-8100\nCourthouse Administration Hours:\nMonday – Friday 8:00 AM – 5:00 PM",
